  "interpretation": "In the same original Gmail process, Android’s account manager returned one Google account on 14 calls. The official Play services account provider returned an empty array on all 7 observed Google account queries. On 4 of those calls, the live stack included Gmail’s own account-list builder. Gmail’s internal account list had published zero entries in three samples. The Gmail process was connected to microG; the live official Play services listener had no account connector configured. These results locate the empty reply on this board configuration. An otherwise matched run with the official service also connected is still needed to determine the effect of that connection.",
